  "axes": "Metres, Godot+Yup. Shelf localX=depth,localZ=length. Bottom-centre origin,identityrotation,unitscale. Cargo nativeX=length; use exact Packet rotations intentionally.",
  "parent": "Materials_Visual/Body_Pivot/Cargo_Floor. Existing marker is truck(0,1.02,1.7176246643); placement table is RELATIVE to that marker, with no extra1.02 offset.",
  "restraints": "Restraint_00 etc are separate static mesh children; remove corresponding one BEFORE pickup.20mm low lips,50mm release. No new restraint mechanism animation.",
  "support": "Deck markers are actual upper support planes. Clear bay650x480mm is free space; flat support is644x474mm on S2/S3,628x458mm padding on S4. Padding lies inside30mm structure.",
  "packet_contract": "Packet_00_00 etc are mesh-bottom pivots. Standard Packet yawY=-90degrees turns medium600mm nativeX along rackZ. S3 Can_Packet slots have identityrotation and Z\u00b1160mm: two300mm cans along racklength,400mm acrossdepth. One keg OR two cans perlevel; not both. No extra unsupported stacks inferred.",
  "height_limits": "S2 pitch450mm minus30structure=420clear;50release leaves370mm packageH, so400mm bale belongs in S4. S3/S4 pitch600 gives570clear;500keg70mm remaining /420can150mm.",
  "grip_limit": "Approach and Extract markers are PROVISIONAL alignment references. Actual anatomical pickup/contact/path remains unvalidated; these static exports do not grant a worker route through occupied racks.",
  "stock": "Shared visuals only, no new stock. Runtime material labels and actual netkg/capacity including partials; quantities/fees unchanged.",
  "collision": "Visual GLBs have no proxies. Lead owns matching runtime collision and reservations.",
  "provenance": "Original artist-authored shelf geometry and project palette. Concept sheets preceded bounded fixed-Luna viewing references; no external mesh/texture incorporated. See concept_review_v01.md and reference_selection_v01.md.",
